    {
      "id": "8e6588ca-40b9-43a6-939c-ffef664d305a",
      "title": "Leia o contraste e observe o que cada palavra nomeia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0b737e64-99d1-42d2-a733-2197d2cdd499",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>carnicería</strong> e <strong>pescadería</strong> são nomes de lojas diferentes.</p><ul><li><strong>carnicería</strong>: lugar para comprar carne</li><li><strong>pescadería</strong>: lugar para comprar peixe</li></ul><p>As duas palavras falam do local de compra.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1f4f85bf-dbdc-4b69-99e9-efdd7956f39a",
      "title": "Escute o nome da loja, observe a escrita e veja a tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "34d0963a-c7bd-4f21-9289-d6cccbee62b1",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe mais um nome de loja.</p><p><strong>frutería</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>frutaria</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c35edbe3f250489f85bbf7a70515e2a7_b07-fruteria.mp3?Expires=1794099490&Signature=Xze3Eb9UEQsTHhYsujN-6iYmrTu6OZTiyXGfv7iIbotA-Gi8ZDdgBztl~n3h9IiNS0dz-6eSjfUq9UsS1f4446HuFRWKVAAcDX1n7u-asuJqrc1XrxPVcsMVOwXBsL24QXIdisPhfTyINIJ~roV-Abd5TlbUIKJAzlgtapceWqLM8GTRPDhqIAlaNi28rx-Hcex4ljYG9izmOXN7-Cw9lueQR9Lt3r7SHV9nBuQBmpaisHdrKa8oLMkK6fvFMn3HWW0FwWnZEhXvLYarlBvA2EbyxOwhfO4PKE9Gnz6f9g0xAZaybz1MFaVAhLxQ0NZPyHjX5zjJv6X9DlHN7FSoJQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
